flowchart LR

Start[User Opens PubliQ] --> Upload[Upload Government Documents]
Upload --> Process[Extract & Chunk Text]
Process --> Embed[Generate Embeddings]
Embed --> Store[Store in ChromaDB]

Query[User Asks Question] --> Retrieve[Retrieve Relevant Chunks]
Retrieve --> Context[Assemble Context]
Context --> LLM[AWS Bedrock Model]
LLM --> Cite[Attach Source Citations]
Cite --> Answer[Return Answer to User]

Store --> Retrieve
